{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "DeepSeek-OCR-WebUI API",
    "description": "自托管的 DeepSeek-OCR-2 服务。引擎：vLLM（CUDA，连续批处理）或 transformers（CUDA / Apple Silicon / CPU）。\n\n**限额**：单文件 ≤ 200 MB · 图片 ≤ 80 MP · PDF 单次 ≤ 500 页（144 DPI 栅格化，每页 ≤ 60 MP）· 单页生成 ≤ 8192 token · 单请求超时 600s。\n\n**错误格式**：`{\"success\": false, \"detail\": {\"error\", \"message\", \"actual\", \"limit\"}, \"request_id\"}`。\n\n**产物判据**：每页返回 `ok` 与 `warnings[]`（repetition / repetition_cut / truncated / coordinate_loop / bbox_invalid / empty_output / near_empty）。HTTP 200 只代表请求被处理，请以 `ok` 判断产物是否可信。",
    "version": "5.0.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "health"
        ],
        "summary": "就绪与队列状态",
        "description": "模型加载与预热完成前返回 **503**（`status=starting|error`）；就绪后 200，`status` ∈ healthy / busy / full。带 `X-Client-ID` 头时返回该客户端的排队位置。",
        "operationId": "health_health_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "加载中或不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/health/live": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "health"
        ],
        "summary": "存活探针",
        "description": "进程存活即返回 200。",
        "operationId": "live_health_live_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "additionalProperties": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "title": "Response Live Health Live Get"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/capabilities": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "meta"
        ],
        "summary": "能力声明",
        "description": "识别模式、限额、当前引擎与已知弱项（附公开榜单证据）。",
        "operationId": "capabilities_api_capabilities_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CapabilitiesResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/ocr": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "ocr"
        ],
        "summary": "图片 OCR",
        "description": "上传一张图片（PNG/JPEG/WebP/BMP/TIFF/GIF，按文件头识别），返回识别文本、原始输出（含 grounding 标记）、版面框（像素坐标）与逐页判据。\n\n- `prompt_type`：document（默认）· ocr · free · figure · describe · find · freeform\n- `find_term`：find 模式的关键词 · `custom_prompt`：freeform 模式的提示词\n- `grounding`：document / ocr / freeform 可切换是否输出版面框；不传 = 模式默认\n- 头 `X-Client-ID`：同一客户端的并发上限与排队位置",
        "operationId": "api_ocr_api_ocr_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "multipart/form-data": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Body_api_ocr_api_ocr_post"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OCRResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "413": {
            "description": "文件 / 像素超限"
          },
          "415": {
            "description": "不支持的类型"
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "参数不合法"
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "排队已满 / 并发超限"
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "模型加载中 / 显存不足"
          },
          "504": {
            "description": "推理超时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/ocr": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "compat"
        ],
        "summary": "图片 OCR（v4 兼容别名）",
        "description": "与 `/api/ocr` 完全相同。",
        "operationId": "legacy_ocr_ocr_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "multipart/form-data": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Body_legacy_ocr_ocr_post"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OCRResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "deprecated": true
      }
    },
    "/api/ocr/pdf": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "ocr"
        ],
        "summary": "PDF 逐页 OCR（NDJSON 流）",
        "description": "逐页栅格化（144 DPI）并识别，`application/x-ndjson` 每行一个事件：\n\n- `{\"type\":\"start\",\"page_count\",\"pages\":[1,2,…]}`\n- `{\"type\":\"page\",\"page\":1, …与 /api/ocr 相同的字段}`（按页序输出）\n- `{\"type\":\"heartbeat\"}`（每 15 s，防反向代理空闲断开）\n- `{\"type\":\"error\",\"page\",\"detail\"}`（单页失败不中断其余页）\n- `{\"type\":\"done\",\"ok_pages\",\"warned_pages\",\"failed_pages\",\"elapsed_s\"}`\n\n`pages` 参数如 `1-3,5`；输入校验（加密 / 页数 / 像素）在开流之前完成，失败直接返回 4xx。",
        "operationId": "api_ocr_pdf_api_ocr_pdf_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "multipart/form-data": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Body_api_ocr_pdf_api_ocr_pdf_post"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              },
              "application/x-ndjson": {}
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/pdf-to-images": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "compat"
        ],
        "summary": "PDF → 页图（v4 兼容）",
        "description": "返回每页 base64 PNG。deprecated：大文件请用 `/api/ocr/pdf`。上限 500 页。",
        "operationId": "legacy_pdf_to_images_pdf_to_images_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "multipart/form-data": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Body_legacy_pdf_to_images_pdf_to_images_post"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "additionalProperties": true,
                  "type": "object",
                  "title": "Response Legacy Pdf To Images Pdf To Images Post"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "deprecated": true
      }
    }
  },
